---
import BentoItem from "./bentoItem.astro"
---

<section class="relative min-h-screen w-full z-30 text-white overflow-hidden">

  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
    <img src="../../public/history-bg.jpg" alt="background" class="w-full h-full object-cover">
  </div>


  <div class="relative z-10 py-16 max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4">

    <div class="flex justify-center text-4xl font-semibold">
      <h2 class="uppercase">History</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="text-lg text-center font-light mt-6">
      <p class="my-6">The METAL GEAR series got its start in 1987―over 35 years ago―spawning several titles, spinoffs, and ports. Here's a look back at Snake's story explored in the games.</p>

      <p class="my-6">The epic saga spans 50 years, from all the way back in the 1960s up to the 2010s.</p>
    </div>

    <BentoItem />
    
  </div>
</section>
